Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚当没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Adam's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不知道卡西怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个关路西法的牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cage you sprung lucifer from ...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以再把他扔回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can shove his ass back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要打开牢笼  天启四骑士手上的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key to the cage ... four rings from the horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿到了战争的  还拿到了饥荒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we got War's. We nicked Famine's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.66,0:00:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有2个戒指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two rings down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凑齐4枚戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collect all four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮你们抓住瘟疫骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you pestilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.56,0:00:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底要不要天启四骑士的戒指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want the horsemen rings or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们面对的是什么  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we dealing with? Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔病毒  瘟疫和灾祸的病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Croatoan. Virus of plague and pestilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.54,0:00:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像是恶魔细菌战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like demonic germ warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要我们的疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want our vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要我们的疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need our vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这被称为"急需品"  同志们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called "Demand," People. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就开始供应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, supply!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阁下  好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疫苗的试验结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vaccine trials ... the results have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对足够荒唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Really quite grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:53.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你会高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:00:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello, Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:00:59.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你许一个愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以满足你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you anything you want, mate ...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.86,0:01:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然也包括死亡骑士的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to and including death's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.90,0:01:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:06.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能打开牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say we can open the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但然后又能如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们引诱路西法到牢笼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you guys lead the devil to the edge
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我跳进去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I jump in?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.83,0:01:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(衣阿华州达分波特市)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格林医生  旅行愉快吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Green, how was your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:26.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收获颇丰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, very productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜爱的病人莎莉丝特  今晚感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we tonight, Celeste, my favorite patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护士说你睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nurse says you can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:37.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我越来越难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just feel worse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:41.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是因为你现在患的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's because you're suffering from a combination
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the common cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,登革热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dengue fever...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有严重的日本脑炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a nasty, nasty case of Japanese encephalitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I ...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到我说的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:02:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.65,0:02:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小时候没得过水痘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never had chicken pox as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.86,0:02:06.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is gonna be fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.79,0:02:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是...  我怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I ... h-how could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.76,0:02:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下患上这么多病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have all those diseases at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我用有盖培养皿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a proprietary blend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.53,0:02:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调配的专利混合制剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mix it up in a petri dish ...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.47,0:02:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  就是我的培养皿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The petri dish being... You.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息下  会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try relax. It'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会...  治好我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you... Gonna c-cure me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.15,0:02:28.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:30.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:50.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你犯的什么病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.73,0:02:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(一天前)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  - 少给我来这套\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean ...  - Don't "Dean" Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说你  以前也没少犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you ... you have had some stupid ideas in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这次  这事你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this ... d-did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-知道什么  - 萨姆的天才计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - About Sam's genius plan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要同意路西法附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}to say yes to the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢提醒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for the heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  别冲我来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this ain't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和鲍比都这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the consensus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.06,0:03:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛  真棒  讨论结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Awesome. Then, end of discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  - 卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:26.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都以为你死了  伙计你在哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all thought you were dead. Where the hell are you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.27,0:03:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以说详细点儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to elaborate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚在这里醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just woke up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生们很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctors were fairly surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们以为我脑死亡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They thought I was brain-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你住院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-so, a hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然  范奈司那天之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, after Van Nuys,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.63,0:03:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我突然出现在德拉克洛瓦一艘捕虾船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suddenly appeared, bloody and unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.66,0:03:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑身是血  不省人事\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a shrimping boat off Delacroix.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说水手们很惊慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told it upset the sailors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, I got to tell you, man ...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.44,0:03:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来得正是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:59.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到收拾路西法的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We figured out a way to pop Satan's box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:01.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长  不过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long story, but, look ...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在追杀瘟疫骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going after Pestilence now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以如果你想瞬移过来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you want to zap over here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.58,0:04:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在不能瞬移\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't "zap" anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.65,0:04:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:12.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以理解成  我的电力枯竭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could say my batteries are ... are drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思  你失去天使超能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? You're out of angel mojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:16.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很口渴  我的头也很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying that I am thirsty and my head aches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还被虫子咬了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a bug bite
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.31,0:04:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管我怎么挠还是很痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}that itches no matter how much I scratch it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思就是  我现在像极了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm saying that I'm just incredibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是  没有钱坐飞机的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my point is -- I can't go anywhere without money
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就哪儿也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for...an airplane ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没钱买吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理论上说我也没钱付止痛药的费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more pain medication, ideally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有鲍比在  他会给你汇钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Bobby's here. He'll wire you the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  等等  - 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, wait. - I will?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有答应米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said "No" to Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我为我的误解道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.62,0:04:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你并不是我想的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not the burnt and broken shell of a man
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脑筋不清而且容易屈服的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I believed you to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.00,0:05:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:03.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感激至极\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.01,0:05:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(宁静谷疗养院)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:24.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是邪恶医生的老窝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is Dr. Evil's lair, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可比"邪恶"还让人压抑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of more depressing than evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是在叫你珍惜青春  珍爱生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a four-color brochure for dying young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对瘟疫骑士而言  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, to Pestilence, 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是他的世外桃源\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's probably dollywood in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:43.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整楼都是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole building full of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.54,0:05:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道哪个是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know who's human,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个是恶魔  哪个又是瘟疫骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's demon, and who's Pestilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.92,0:05:54.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我在找我的祖母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hi. Uh, I'm looking for my nana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.43,0:06:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫尤妮斯·肯尼迪(国际特奥会创始人)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, her name is Eunice Kennedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:09.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去前台问问护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go around front and see the nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生你能帮帮我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind just helping me out, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她大概  这么小\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, she's about, uh, about that small
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.51,0:06:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头发灰白  穿着尿布\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gray hair, wears diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤妮斯·肯尼迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eunice Kennedy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆  即兴发挥而已   \N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the beauty about improv, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:33.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你永远想不到你嘴里会蹦出什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never know what's gonna come out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们到底在找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we even looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他号称瘟疫骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's Pestilence, 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以可能看起来病歪歪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he probably looks sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里每个人都病歪歪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody looks sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.07,0:07:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠点谱儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格林医生  旅行愉快吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Green, how was your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.08,0:07:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收获颇丰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, very productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜爱的病人莎莉丝特\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we tonight, Celeste,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}my favorite patient?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.45,0:08:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特兄弟来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the Winchesters are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:09.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是撤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.53,0:08:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.90,0:08:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们之前打败过天启骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have a track record with horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:22.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是指我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们对我兄弟干的那些好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they did to my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们要做的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reasonable thing to do here is to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们尝尝被瘟疫折磨的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}take it out of their healthy young asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要严守指令  \N{\fnArial\fs30}We're under strict orders 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能杀掉皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to kill the vessels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法那么想得到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, if Satan wants them so bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可以把他们的碎尸再拼回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he can glue them back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.85,0:09:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她有生命危险就呼叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page me if she's dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.27,0:10:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定离瘟疫骑士很近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.28,0:10:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.77,0:10:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生现在就接见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:45.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.88,0:10:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两兄弟看起来不太好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys don't look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是得了猩红热\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be the, uh, scarlet fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是脑膜炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, uh, the meningitis. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有可能是梅毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the syphilis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不是闹着玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你们现在感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}However you feel right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后只会更加让人生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna get so very, very much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都不喜欢疾病  你们不觉得么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disease gets a bad rap, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为生病之后会肮脏污秽一塌糊涂\N{\fnArial\fs30}For being filthy. Chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  这只是形容生病的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, but, really, t-that just describes people who get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而疾病本身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disease itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常的纯洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}very...pure...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Single-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:12:00.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,病毒只有一个目的  分而治之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bacteria have one purpose -- divide and conquer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why, in the end...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它总会是赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}it always wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可能会好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've got to wonder 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么上帝要把他全部的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}why God pours all his love
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:17.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倾注在一些又肮脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}into something so messy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又脆弱的东西身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.68,0:12:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能做的  就是证明他错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I can do is show him he's wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次一个传染病\N{\fnArial\fs30}One epidemic at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:34.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果用1到10来分等级\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a scale of 1 to 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的痛苦在第几级呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}how's your pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.75,0:12:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.73,0:12:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我坐公车来的  不用担心  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a bus. Don't worry, I --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎哟  看呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.81,0:12:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小天使占用的皮囊  却如此无能\N{\fnArial\fs30}An occupied vessel, but powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面根本就没有天使了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a speck of angel in you, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还有那么一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just a speck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.54,0:13:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔来个全垒打感觉真不错  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's nice to actually score a home run for once, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘟疫骑士最后说了一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing Pestilence said...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"已经太晚了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"it's too late."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有具体说是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He get specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是有些害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just a little freaked out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:13:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定他还留了一手\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he might have left a bomb somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以拜托告诉我们你有些好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So please tell us you have actual good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:07.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芝加哥很快就会从地图上消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicago's about to be wiped off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.37,0:14:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,史无前例的风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storm of the millennium.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引发了一连串的天灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sets off a daisy chain of natural disasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三百万人将因此送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three million people are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法理解你对"好消息"的定义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand your definition of good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡  天启四骑士之一  他一定会去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death, the horseman -- he's gonna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能在他引发风暴之前阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we can stop him before he kick-starts this storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:32.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿回他的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get his ring back --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒  你说的可真简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you make it sound so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  我只是试着扭转一下局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I'm just trying to put a spin on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.59,0:14:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你是怎么想出这些来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, h-how'd you put all this together, anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得到了一些帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had, you know...help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.85,0:14:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么谦虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我基本没帮上什么忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely helped at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是幸会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure, et cetera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说啊  告诉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不用害羞啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no shame in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.65,0:15:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日就要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}World's gonna end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候还把个小小的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems stupid 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看得那么重就得不偿失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get all precious over one little...soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出卖了你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.53,0:15:31.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确切说是抵押  我绝对会物归原主的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, more like pawned it. I fully intend to give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.04,0:15:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就还给他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我会的  - 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will. - Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你跟他接吻了吗  - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you kiss him? - Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:41.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛要拍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you take a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干吗要用舌头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to use tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You know what? I'm sick of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.27,0:16:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就把他的灵魂还给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him his soul back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  我不能  - 不能还是不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. I can't. - Can't or won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不愿意行了吧  这是个保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't, all right? It's insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.68,0:16:13.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你什么意思  - 你们猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - You kill demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边的大高个儿在这问题上脾气可不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gigantor over there has a temper issue about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们不会杀我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you won't kill me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我还拥有他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}as long as I have that soul in the deposit box.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.09,0:16:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把它还给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll return it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这一切结束并且我安全离开这里之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all this is over, and I can walk safely away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.86,0:16:34.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们达成共识了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we all understand each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我猜猜  你是来找我谈心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. We're about to have a talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说在前头\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意你关于我的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with you. About me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.17,0:17:13.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我太弱  无法击败路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm too weak to take on Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我也这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.01,0:17:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我知道自己多没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know exactly how screwed up I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  鲍比  卡西...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Bobby, Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本没法跟你们相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the least of any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  - 不  这确实是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Sam... - No, it's true. It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们唯一的方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.19,0:17:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果还有另一个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was another way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.13,0:17:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...可我觉得我们无路可走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but I don't think there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用我是唯一的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以除了去尽我的本分\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I don't know what else to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:50.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不知道我还能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except just try t-to do what's got to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something you need to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妮维亚斯制药厂正迅速投放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niveus pharmaceuticals is rushing delivery
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:12.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的猪流感疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}of its new swine-flu vaccine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来"遏制这场空前的猪流感暴发"\N{\fnArial\fs30}to "stem the tide of the unprecedented outbreak."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.02,0:18:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,货船会在星期三出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, shipments leave Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妮维亚斯制药厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Niveus pharmaceuticals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好你俩长的帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are lucky you have your looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:31.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的恶魔恋人  布莱迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your demon lover, Brady?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妮维亚斯的营销副总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}V.P. Of distribution, Niveus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.40,0:18:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  听起来像是如意算盘打得噼啪响吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes, that's the sound of the abacus clacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都知道是什么情况了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all caught up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.14,0:18:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说  是瘟疫骑士在散播猪流感\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Pestilence was spreading swine flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  但可不是为了好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but not just for giggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是第一步  第二步是疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was step one. Step two is the vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.60,0:18:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你认为...  - 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you think -- - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用我的名声担保\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stake my reputation --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些疫苗装满了上等的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That vaccine is chock-full of grade-a,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新鲜出炉的恶魔病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}farm-fresh croatoan virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会同时发往全国各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simultaneous, countrywide distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.18,0:19:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个"好"计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:05.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们能成为骑士可不是一点本事都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't get to be horsemen for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  你们俩最好还是考虑得\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you boys better stock up on...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周全妥当些\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下周四的这时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time next Thursday,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:15.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将生活在僵尸世界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll all be living in zombieland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(芝加哥  伊利诺伊州)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.20,0:19:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.28,0:19:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.30,0:20:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  走路长点眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch where you're walking, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.48,0:20:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.98,0:20:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是他们所说的"最后关头"  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what they mean by "the 11th hour", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:02.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这是最后时刻  而我却是个废人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the 11th hour, and I am useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手里只有这把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have is this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿着它又能做什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I even supposed to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.28,0:21:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞄准  然后射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point it and shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I used to be --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真打算跟我发牢骚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really gonna bitch -- to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别感伤于过去的光辉岁月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit pining for the varsity years...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧把东西装上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}and load the damn truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.27,0:21:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们"阻止僵尸启示录行动"好运 \N{\fnArial\fs30}good luck stopping the whole zombie apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.77,0:21:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:43.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你成功干掉死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck killing Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.13,0:21:45.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.25,0:21:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得曾经一起猎杀食人怪的日子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when we used to just... hunt wendigos?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都那么的简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}How simple things were?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不尽然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个你可能用得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you might need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留着吧  迪恩有武器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it. Dean's covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.76,0:22:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这东西是死亡骑士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death's own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能轻松干掉神  恶魔  天使和死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kills, golly, demons and angels and reapers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.68,0:22:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中的就是这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, rumor has it, the very thing itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪得到它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.45,0:22:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我可是十字路口交易恶魔的头头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello -- king of the Crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.16,0:22:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你就傻坐在那儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you just gonna sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我打算跳跳大河之舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna riverdance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.50,0:22:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看可以  好吓这两位美女一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose if you want to impress the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比啊鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, Bobby, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真的浪费了这交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really wasted that crossroads deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.86,0:22:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  只要你好好利用  会获益更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact -- you get more if you phrase it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我为你考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I took the liberty of adding
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自作主张稍稍修改了交易条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}a teeny little sub-a clause on your behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.46,0:23:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能咋说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我处处为他人着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an altruist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.06,0:23:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真就打算一直坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gonna sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.99,0:23:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A son of bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.52,0:23:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我知道  你这交易绝对值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. Completely worth your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.92,0:23:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a hell of a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.81,0:23:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场景也太傲娇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is getting maudlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.57,0:24:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同意做路西法的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yes" to Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后跟他同归于尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then jump in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这计划还真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an interesting plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.53,0:24:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,形容的真贴切  这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a word for it. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拐弯抹角  直说这是你听过最烂的计划吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and tell me it's the worst plan you ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.13,0:24:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.46,0:24:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你想听那个  我很乐意满足你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am happy to say that if that's what you want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.40,0:24:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.87,0:24:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和迪恩总是让我出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dean have a habit of exceeding my expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.99,0:24:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他拒绝米迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He resisted Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.47,0:24:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你也可以拒绝路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could resist Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但有些事你要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are things that you would need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.86,0:24:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.90,0:24:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒找到了另一个皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael has found another vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.29,0:24:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.66,0:24:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你弟弟  亚当\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your brother Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.22,0:24:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该已经想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have considered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.89,0:24:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直想逃避这问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were trying not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.93,0:24:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.81,0:24:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你答应了路西法  \N{\fnArial\fs30}if you say yes to Lucifer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.61,0:24:55.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但却未能成功实施计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then fail...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:24:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场大战就无可避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}this fight will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.43,0:25:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这带来的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the collateral...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.81,0:25:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将会不堪设想\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be immense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.18,0:25:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还牵扯到恶魔血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's also the demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.59,0:25:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你说啥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.65,0:25:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉路西法的前提是\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take in Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.70,0:25:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要喝比以前多得多的恶魔血\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be more than you've ever drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.34,0:25:16.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.29,0:25:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它使皮囊变得更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It strengthens the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.20,0:25:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以防止皮囊爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps it from exploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.28,0:25:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他现在的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the guy he's in now --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.36,0:25:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经喝得相当多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is drinking gallons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.74,0:25:26.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然还说这不是史上最烂的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how is that not the worst plan you ever heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.17,0:25:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在往卡车上装一罐罐的恶魔病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, they're loading up pot shots of croatoan in the trucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.05,0:25:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  第一辆车一小时内不会开走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. First truck don't leave for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.66,0:25:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们溜进去  每隔25英尺埋下C-4炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get in, we plant the c-4 every 25 feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.71,0:25:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后敲响火险警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we pull the fire alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.81,0:25:50.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辆卡车要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That truck is leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.42,0:25:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.44,0:25:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  新计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.47,0:26:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特兄弟来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.53,0:26:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来给他们点颜色瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, let's bake them up a little treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.30,0:26:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-救命  - 走侧门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help! - Side door!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.61,0:26:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.51,0:26:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来  快点  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Come on. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我  求求你们  救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! please! help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.52,0:27:28.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面还有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's still people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.83,0:27:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.49,0:27:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.45,0:27:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:51.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们停下来吃点披萨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's stop for pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.48,0:27:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.58,0:27:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是听说味道不错罢了  没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just heard it was good. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.88,0:27:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在前面  又大又丑的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up ahead. Big, ugly building.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.14,0:27:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆心投影点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.20,0:28:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以说是骑士的马棚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horseman's stable, if you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.41,0:28:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.88,0:28:03.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.34,0:28:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才刚认识我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you met me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.66,0:28:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.26,0:28:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  这街道聚集着大量的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, the block is squirming with reapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.34,0:28:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.67,0:28:24.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  我脸红了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, is my face red.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.59,0:28:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡骑士不在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.95,0:28:28.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to cut the cute
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.90,0:28:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧告诉我他究竟在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get to the part where you tell me where he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.74,0:28:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.47,0:28:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.28,0:28:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.08,0:28:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迹象表明他就在里面  现在我和你一样惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signs pointed. I-I'm just as shocked as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.14,0:28:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比为了这个出卖自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby sold his soul for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.30,0:28:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.38,0:28:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有交易要么返还灵魂要么先赊账\N{\fnArial\fs30}All deals are soul back or store credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.97,0:28:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在下一座死亡之城找到死骑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll catch death in the next doomed city.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.74,0:28:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力  无数的人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.80,0:28:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无数人都会随时死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions of people are about to die any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.91,0:28:55.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我强烈建议赶紧离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I strongly suggest we get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.47,0:29:07.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.53,0:29:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.88,0:29:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.93,0:29:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道报告说有炸弹吗  一千枚炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call in a bomb threat? 1,000 bomb threats?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.73,0:29:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么让三百万芝加哥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how the hell am I supposed to get
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.89,0:29:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在十分钟之内全部撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three million people out of Chicago in the next 10 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.51,0:29:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.03,0:30:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我听不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.74,0:30:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.18,0:30:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死亡骑士  他在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death -- he's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.99,0:30:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我一起...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming or...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.40,0:30:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}...not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.30,0:30:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.40,0:30:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面没人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.03,0:30:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.22,0:30:56.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这些东西还蛮有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, these things can be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.58,0:31:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这已经可以被认定是国内恐怖事件了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we commit our act of domestic terrorism already?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.68,0:31:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.63,0:32:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你将原物归还\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for returning that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.32,0:32:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起吃吧  迪恩 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.85,0:32:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,披萨很好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pizza's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.62,0:32:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到我可花了你很长时间啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took you long enough to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.35,0:32:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直期待着能与你聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been wanting to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.58,0:32:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.57,0:32:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的感觉很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mix feelings about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.82,0:32:53.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是不是到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}S-so is this the part where...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.87,0:32:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}...where you kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.96,0:33:07.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太高估自己重要性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an inflated sense of your importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.46,0:33:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的地位和你的地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a thing like me, a thing like you, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.55,0:33:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试想如果桌边有个细菌坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think how you'd feel if a bacterium sat at your table
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.01,0:33:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且开始恶声恶气的说话  你会怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}and started to get snarky.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.50,0:33:26.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是小小太阳系里的一颗小行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one little planet in one tiny solar system
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.90,0:33:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银河系里的沧海一粟\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a galaxy that's barely out of its diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.69,0:33:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.67,0:33:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very old.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.73,0:33:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I invite you to contemplate
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.13,0:33:40.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我来说有多么渺小\N{\fnArial\fs30}How insignificant I find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.83,0:33:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.98,0:34:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好吃  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.68,0:34:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.80,0:34:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.15,0:34:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和上帝一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}As old as god.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.12,0:34:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能更老些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe older.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.22,0:34:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩都记不得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of us can remember anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.70,0:34:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生命  死亡  鸡肉  鸡蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life, death, chicken, egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.54,0:34:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都毫无意义  最终他的生命也将被我终结  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Regardless -- at the end, I'll reap him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.55,0:34:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.84,0:34:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要终结上帝的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll reap god?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.29,0:34:48.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.04,0:34:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝也会死的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}God will die, too, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.97,0:35:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太超越我的想象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is way above my pay grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.50,0:35:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高一点点而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.95,0:35:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你不杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then why am I still breathing,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.93,0:35:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍然让我坐在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sitting here with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.43,0:35:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh... w-what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.18,0:35:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解开我的束缚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leash around my neck -- off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.73,0:35:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法用一些肮脏的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer has me bound to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.73,0:35:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,束缚着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some unseemly little spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.66,0:35:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他随心所欲的控制我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has me where he wants, when he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.50,0:35:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我没法去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I couldn't go to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.81,0:35:29.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能等着你来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to wait for you to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.72,0:35:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把我变成了他的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made me his weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.01,0:35:37.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飓风  洪水  高涨的死亡率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurricanes, floods, raising the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.46,0:35:39.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我远比你厉害得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more powerful than you can process,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.93,0:35:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我却要受制于脾气暴戾又讨厌的小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm enslaved to a bratty child with a temper tantrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.45,0:35:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.72,0:35:49.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can unbind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.04,0:35:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你荒谬的想法真是层出不穷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your ridiculous bravado again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.12,0:35:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不可能靠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.67,0:35:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你可以帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can help me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.20,0:35:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我卸去路西法手中的王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the bullets out of Lucifer's gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.80,0:36:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand you want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.44,0:36:08.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.22,0:36:10.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很乐意把这个给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm inclined to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.74,0:36:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To give it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.62,0:36:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.45,0:36:18.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那芝加哥会如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about... chicago?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.57,0:36:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也可以手下留情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.15,0:36:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我挺喜欢这披萨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.38,0:36:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有几个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.70,0:36:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  比如呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Like?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.11,0:36:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须不惜一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to do whatever it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.80,0:36:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把路西法关回到牢笼去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To put lucifer in his cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.02,0:36:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.66,0:36:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不惜一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.69,0:36:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.50,0:36:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  还没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No plan. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.08,0:36:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.39,0:36:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可以阻止路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one that can stop Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.01,0:36:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是唯一能阻止他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.06,0:37:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.57,0:37:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.24,0:37:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我需要你的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I need a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.90,0:37:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会让你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to let your brother
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.43,0:37:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纵身跳入那个火坑中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump right into that fiery pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.26,0:37:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以向我保证吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do I have your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.96,0:37:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  好的  我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.48,0:37:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好遵守承诺  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That had better be "yes," Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.60,0:37:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该清楚欺骗死亡骑士的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can't cheat death.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.20,0:37:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我来给你讲解一下使用手册\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, would you like the instruction manual?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.98,0:38:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能重新站起来的感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd it go at the rockettes audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.61,0:38:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你表演个高踢腿  美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, high kicks -- fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.89,0:38:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我没咪咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boobs need work.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.14,0:38:29.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我整晚都没理由得上上下下走个不停\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walked up and down stairs all night for no damn reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.81,0:38:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是累死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.66,0:38:37.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好极了  真怕这是场梦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels so good, I'm scared it's a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.59,0:38:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我想起了水深火热的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I remember that the world's dying bloody,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.91,0:38:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要喝的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.44,0:38:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.69,0:39:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么死亡骑士告诉你怎么用它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So death told you how to operate those?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.61,0:39:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.53,0:39:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.87,0:39:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  可是现在问题更难办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, I got bigger problems now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.85,0:39:12.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Like?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.38,0:39:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欺骗死亡骑士　下场会怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think death does to people who lie to his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.72,0:39:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-绝没好事  - 同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing good. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.56,0:39:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.10,0:39:24.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我居然同意让萨姆作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was cool with Sam driving the bus
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.66,0:39:26.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终结路西法计划的执行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the whole Lucifer plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.86,0:39:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说死亡骑士认为萨姆应该说"同意"\N{\fnArial\fs30}So death thinks Sam ought to say yes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.76,0:39:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  估计是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.03,0:39:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然他肯定会这么说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, I mean, of course he'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.20,0:39:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是给路西法跑腿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He works for Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.37,0:39:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是说他也不想那样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against his will, I thought he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.37,0:39:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒觉得是他加油添醋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd say, take his sob story with a fat grain of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.43,0:39:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he is death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.32,0:39:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他可是死亡骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. He's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.44,0:39:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从大局观考虑的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the kind of bird's-eye view.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.82,0:39:51.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.58,0:39:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我也就说说  - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm just saying -- - Well, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.47,0:39:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是一直很反对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what happened to you being against this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.77,0:39:56.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好  我也觉得萨姆这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm not saying Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.70,0:39:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上有各种性格缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't an ass-full of character defects.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.57,0:40:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不过  - 不过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But... - But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.10,0:40:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在尼维亚斯的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at niveus?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.74,0:40:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看着这孩子将老百姓一个个救出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched that kid pull one civilian out after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.99,0:40:09.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救出了十多个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have saved 10 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.46,0:40:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有停止  没有犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never stopped. Never slowed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.96,0:40:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对他太严苛了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hard on him, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.71,0:40:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.67,0:40:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the meantime...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.27,0:40:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从他12岁起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been running into burning buildings
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.66,0:40:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就义务反顾地冲进着火的大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since he was, what, 12?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.61,0:40:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.19,0:40:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam's got a...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.37,0:40:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有邪恶的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.07,0:40:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我承认这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying he don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.55,0:40:35.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他也有很多善良的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's got a hell of a lot of good in him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.92,0:40:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就该知道他能打败路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know Sam will beat the devil...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.39,0:40:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他会尽力尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or die trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.01,0:40:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还能要求他做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the best we could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.61,0:40:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我问你  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I got to ask, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.80,0:40:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟在害怕什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.71,0:41:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是怕失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.97,0:41:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是害怕失去你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or losing your brother?
